Desktop Melee is not under a single license. In short:

- Desktop Melee (desktop-melee/), the port code (src/pc/), tools and build
  files: GPL-3.0-or-later. The full text is in licenses/COPYING.
- Melee's decompiled game code (src/melee/, src/sysdolphin/): not licensed.
  It is a decompilation of a Nintendo game (from doldecomp/melee), and no one
  here can grant a license to it.
- Third-party components keep their own licenses (MIT, zlib, BSD, OFL).

The details, including every melee-pc file Desktop Melee changed, are in
licenses/LICENSE.md.

"Super Smash Bros." and "Melee" are trademarks of Nintendo. Desktop Melee is
an unofficial fan project, not affiliated with or endorsed by Nintendo or HAL
Laboratory.
